WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
Lie face down, hands beside the lower ribs, tops of the feet pressing down.

2
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Press firmly into the hands and straighten the arms, lifting the chest and thighs off the floor.

3
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Roll the shoulders back and down, drawing the chest forward through the arms.

4
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Only the hands and tops of the feet touch the floor; lengthen the tailbone and gaze forward.
